#% title
# weierstrass_invariant_g2

#% text
# `weierstrass_invariant_g2([omega1, omega3])` gives the invariant `g2` of the lattice with half-periods `omega1`, `omega3`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The first part of `weierstrass_invariants([omega1, omega3])`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
weierstrass_invariant_g2([1.0, 2.0*im])
#% output
#= 8.124218443053017

#% cell
n(weierstrass_invariant_g2([1, 2*im]), 30)
#% output
#= 8.124218443053017090717481882359900

#% cell
weierstrass_invariant_g2([1, im])
#% output
#= gamma(1/4)^8/(256*pi^2)

